// Copy to Signing.xcconfig and fill in your own Apple Developer Team ID,
// found in Xcode under Settings > Accounts, or in the Apple Developer portal
// under Membership details.
//
// Signing.xcconfig is gitignored: signing identity belongs to whoever is
// building, not to the repository. Debug.xcconfig and Release.xcconfig pull
// it in with an optional include, so the project still opens without it.
//
// Simulator and macOS builds need no team at all. Only a build for a physical
// iOS device does.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
